[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2828105426","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/105713#issuecomment-2828105426","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105713","id":2828105426,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6okXbS","user":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-24T15:48:07Z","updated_at":"2025-04-24T15:48:07Z","body":"I don't know what mpirun is, but it seems to use the same ports as our LSP (6005) and DAP (6006).\n\nYou can configure those ports with `--lsp-port` and `--dap-port` on the command line, or the `network/language_server/remote_port` and `network/debug_adapter/remote_port` project settings.\n\nIf that's confirmed to be the issue, I would suggest reporting a bug to mpirun that it breaks without useful output when the ports it wants to use are already taken.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2828105426/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2829689462","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/105713#issuecomment-2829689462","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105713","id":2829689462,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6oqaJ2","user":{"login":"jean-dupond","id":95272490,"node_id":"U_kgDOBa2-Kg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/95272490?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jean-dupond","html_url":"https://github.com/jean-dupond","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jean-dupond/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jean-dupond/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jean-dupond/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jean-dupond/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jean-dupond/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jean-dupond/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jean-dupond/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jean-dupond/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jean-dupond/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-25T08:12:02Z","updated_at":"2025-04-25T08:12:02Z","body":"`mpirun` is a popular command from [OpenMPI](https://www.open-mpi.org/) to launch parallel processes.\n```\n$ mpirun --version\nmpirun (Open MPI) 4.1.6\n\nReport bugs to http://www.open-mpi.org/community/help/\n```\n\n I thought Godot would use this internally but I understand it's not the case.\n\nUnfortunately options `--lsp-port` and `--dap-port` don't work:\n```\n$ netstat -lntu | grep -E \"(6005|6006|7705|7706)\"\n$ # Returns nothing.\n$ ./Godot_v4.4.1-stable_linux.x86_64 --lsp-port 7705 --dap-port 7706\n$ # Open a project in Godot and type:\n$ netstat -lntu | grep -E \"(6005|6006|7705|7706)\"\ntcp        0      0 127.0.0.1:6006          0.0.0.0:*               LISTEN\ntcp        0      0 127.0.0.1:6005          0.0.0.0:*               LISTEN\n$ Ports 6005 and 6006 still used.\n```\n\nI changed ports directly in the Godot's source code and it solved the issue for me. (But of course would be perfect if it could be done through args --lsp-port & --dap-port.)\n\nAll the same, thank you very much for the help!","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2829689462/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2829767222","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/105713#issuecomment-2829767222","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105713","id":2829767222,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6oqtI2","user":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-25T08:44:56Z","updated_at":"2025-04-25T08:44:56Z","body":"The options should work, what you experienced is likely that `./Godot_v4.4.1-stable_linux.x86_64 --lsp-port 7705 --dap-port 7706` opened the project manager with those flags. But when you open a project from the project manager, it's a new instance of Godot, and those flags aren't passed to the new process.\n\nYou should open the project directly with `./Godot_v4.4.1-stable_linux.x86_64 --lsp-port 7705 --dap-port 7706 --editor --path path/to/project`, or change the editor settings I mentioned so you don't need to pass them by command line.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2829767222/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2829837660","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/105713#issuecomment-2829837660","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105713","id":2829837660,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6oq-Vc","user":{"login":"jean-dupond","id":95272490,"node_id":"U_kgDOBa2-Kg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/95272490?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jean-dupond","html_url":"https://github.com/jean-dupond","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jean-dupond/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jean-dupond/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jean-dupond/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jean-dupond/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jean-dupond/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jean-dupond/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jean-dupond/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jean-dupond/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jean-dupond/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-25T09:13:49Z","updated_at":"2025-04-25T09:13:49Z","body":"Successfully changed from within `Editor > Editor Settings...` from within the Godot's GUI.\n\nI put port 0 to deactivate these features and no conflict anymore with mpirun.\n\nThank you so much!","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2829837660/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]